--     override inside an H split (only the split's own sizing block, on
--     the `H(...)` itself, carries a height; SPEC.md's own H/V duality
--     puts per-child variation on the SPLIT AXIS only, main-axis `pref`/
--     `min`/`max`, never the cross axis). Genuinely honest per-group
--     heights (80px / ~28px / ~28px / ~24px) cannot be expressed without
--     either (a) restructuring this row into a `V(H(...), H(...), ...)`
